# Play-by-play parquet is ~466MB and is a CACHE, not a source. It is
# re-downloadable from nflverse by nfl_epa_experiment.py on demand, so
# committing it would push the repo two orders of magnitude past GitHub's
# 100MB-per-file / 1GB-repo comfort zone in exchange for nothing.
data/*.parquet
__pycache__/
*.pyc
